      "showAdvanced": null,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# ZImage Turbo · LITE · Generate\n\n8 steps / CFG 1 / res_multistep. Models selected from the local installation.\n\nEnter a prompt, set size and batch in Resolution, then Queue. Save Image writes the result.\n\nNegative prompts do not affect sampling at CFG 1.\n\nUses native ModelSamplingAuraFlow shift 3 and res_multistep/simple. Do not substitute Base and Turbo weights without changing steps and CFG.\n\nRecipe reference: installed comfyui_workflow_templates_json/templates/image_z_image_turbo.json\n\n### Checked recipe\nZ-Image Turbo: 8 steps, CFG 1, res_multistep / simple. Sampler profile checks model and latent compatibility. Profiles do not select weights: Base, Turbo, Distilled and Edit checkpoints are not interchangeable. Use a fixed seed when comparing changes; increase size only after the prompt and composition work. Negative text has no sampling effect at CFG 1. Shift 3 comes from the Z-Image model; no extra shift node is needed."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# ZImage Turbo · LITE · Generate\n\n8 steps / CFG 1 / res_multistep. Models selected from the local installation.\n\nEnter a prompt, set size and batch in Resolution, then Queue. Save Image writes the result.\n\nNegative prompts do not affect sampling at CFG 1.\n\nUses native ModelSamplingAuraFlow shift 3 and res_multistep/simple. Do not substitute Base and Turbo weights without changing steps and CFG.\n\nRecipe reference: installed comfyui_workflow_templates_json/templates/image_z_image_turbo.json\n\n### Checked recipe\nZ-Image Turbo: 8 steps, CFG 1, res_multistep / simple. Sampler profile checks model and latent compatibility. Profiles do not select weights: Base, Turbo, Distilled and Edit checkpoints are not interchangeable. Use a fixed seed when comparing changes; increase size only after the prompt and composition work. Negative text has no sampling effect at CFG 1. Shift 3 comes from the Z-Image model; no extra shift node is needed."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
